  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix components except L--cysteine・HCl・H2O and FeSO4・7H2O. Bring to a boil for a few seconds and cool down under a N2 atmosphere. While gassing with N2, add L--cysteine・HCl・H2O and FeSO4・7H2O to the solution, distribute into culture vessels (e.g., 18 ml in 50 ml serum bottles) under a N2 atmosphere, then, seal butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave. Aseptically and anaerobically add per liter (final) the following sterile solutions (autoclaved or *filter--sterilized) from anaerobic stocks:"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Adjust pH of the medium to 7.3 -- 7.7, if necessary."
    }
  ]
}